      "content": "That feeling is known as existential dread, and it is a profoundly human reaction to contemplating the vastness of time. While the universe will indeed expand into an increasingly cold and empty void, our brief existence grants us the unique ability to create meaning, connect deeply with others, and leave a tangible impact. Embracing life as a small, temporary ripple in an infinite ocean can transform that sense of void into something purposeful rather than meaningless.",
      "source": "target",
